@startuml data_flow
participant SPI
participant SPIM as "SPI Multiplexer"
participant Proxy as "Wi-Fi data Proxy"
participant WiFiM as "Net if"
SPI --> SPIM: Interrupt
SPI <-- SPIM: Read link-layer header
SPI <-- SPIM: Read payload (Length)
SPIM --> Proxy: Route by Traffic Type (WIFI_DATA)
Proxy -> WiFiM: Send data
Proxy <- WiFiM: Status
Proxy --> SPIM: Status
hnote over SPIM: Toggle host interrupt
SPIM --> SPI: Transfer header+payload
SPIM --> SPI: Transfer ACK (len=0, error=NO_ERROR)
... Idling ...
hnote over WiFiM: RX data received
WiFiM -> Proxy: RX callback
Proxy --> SPIM: Outgoing msg
hnote over SPIM: Toggle host interrupt
SPIM --> SPI: Transfer header+payload
SPIM --> SPI: Transfer ACK (len=0, error=NO_ERROR)
@enduml